---
title: Secuencia de Boot — Firmware ESP32-S3
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FW as Firmware
    participant I2C as Sensores I2C
    participant WIFI as WiFi Manager
    participant HTTP as Backend HTTP
    participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
    participant TS as ThingSpeak

    Note over FW: Power On / Reset

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of FW: T=0s — BOOT
        FW->>FW: CPU init, GPIO, Serial
        FW->>FW: NVS read (reboot counter, device ID)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note right of FW: T=0-5s — INIT
        FW->>I2C: aht.begin() + ens160.begin()
        I2C-->>FW: I2C OK / NACK
        alt I2C OK
            FW->>FW: Watchdog config (TWDT 12s)
        else I2C FAIL x3
            FW->>FW: → DEGRADED mode
        end
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note right of FW: T=5-15s — WIFI
        FW->>WIFI: WiFi.begin(SSID_1)
        alt Conectado
            WIFI-->>FW: WL_CONNECTED
        else Fallo
            FW->>WIFI: WiFi.begin(SSID_2)
            WIFI-->>FW: WL_CONNECTED / FAIL
        end
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of FW: T=15s — NORMAL
        FW->>HTTP: POST /api/v1/telemetry (boot)
        HTTP-->>FW: 200 OK
        FW->>MQTT: publish mush2/{id}/status (ONLINE, retain)
        MQTT-->>FW: OK
        FW->>MQTT: subscribe mush2/{id}/actuators
        FW->>MQTT: subscribe mush2/{id}/ota/command
        FW->>MQTT: publish mush2/{id}/health
        FW->>TS: HTTP GET telemetry (cada 20s)
    end

    Note over FW: Operación normal: sensores cada 8s, HTTP poll cada 500ms
